    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Nurse Call \u604b\u306e\u30ca\u30fc\u30b9\u30b3\u30fc\u30eb&quot; is a visual novel game where the protagonist, Masatoshi, who is hospitalized after a traffic accident, falls in love while being cared for by two beautiful nurses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist, Masatoshi Fujii, was rushed to a certain hospital due to an unfortunate accident.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When I woke up to the view of an unfamiliar ceiling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But more importantly, two beautiful unfamiliar nurses!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Due to a mistake by the head nurse, Masatoshi ends up being admitted to a VIP room,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and romantic feelings begin to develop during his treatment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, Masatoshi is not the only one who has started to crave something beyond a professional relationship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone's fantasy affair with a beautiful nurse!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And their dreams and goals are...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > As they go through nursing and rehabilitation together, what will become of Masatoshi's relationship with these women?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbAki Manabe</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rookie nurse at the hospital where Masatoshi was admitted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shee is clumsy and, when flustered, sometimes takes unexpected actions at the spur of the moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbKotomi Honjou</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aki's senior, and another nurse in charge of Masatoshi's care.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is dedicated and has a great reputation among the patients. She is fond of her junior, Aki.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbMasatoshi Fujii</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A medical equipment salesman.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He was traveling to various hospitals for work but ended up being hospitalized himself after being injured in an accident.</p>",
